   "speaker": "Mitch Fifield",
   "party": "Liberal",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2013-12-02",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Ozone Protection and Synthetic Greenhouse Gas (Import Levy) Amendment (Carbon Tax Repeal) Bill 2013 was moved to repeal the equivalent carbon tax on synthetic greenhouse gases, ensuring importers of these gases and related products would not face the tax liability for imports after 1 July 2014, thereby reducing costs for businesses in refrigeration and air-conditioning."
